cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "如果你在研究或项目中使用了 statute-rag，请用以下元数据引用它。"
title: "statute-rag: Article-level hybrid statute retrieval with forced verifiable citations"
authors:
  - alias: 1438388098-glitch
version: v0.1.1
date-released: "2026-09-29"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/1438388098-glitch/statute-rag"
keywords:
  - legal
  - chinese
  - retrieval
  - bm25
  - rag
  - citation
  - evaluation
abstract: >-
  A statute-retrieval pipeline that treats the article as the retrieval unit and
  verifiable citations as a hard constraint. Corpus quality gate (14,344 → 14,212
  articles), character-bigram BM25 / LIKE multi-channel RRF fusion with
  colloquial-to-statutory query expansion, and a fully reproducible offline
  evaluation: hybrid Recall@5 98.9% on a synthetic gold (177 questions, fixed
  seed) and 44.7% on a real-question gold (38 genuine web questions, LLM-verified),
  with failure cases and negative results documented. Core has zero third-party
  dependencies.
